                                                "sense_id": "6e071635-17ff-36f8-a70c-8fbd1c51c67f",
                                                "text": "The aroma given off by flowers has an aphrodisiac effect, especially on women. This is so particularly in the case of lilies of the valley, gardenia, frangipani, and henna."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a65d461-43df-479d-8d34-c83975b510e3",
                                                "sense_id": "6e071635-17ff-36f8-a70c-8fbd1c51c67f",
                                                "text": "Heed remembered the baby-powder smell from the bowl of gardenias, their edges browning like toast."
